"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac63-db0e-11ef-a111-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳县","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac64-db0e-11ef-9639-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韋昭曰：在渭城。師古曰：郊祀志云：在長安東北，非渭城也；韋說謬矣。余據水北爲陽，長安在渭南，渭城在渭北，五帝廟或在渭城界，韋說未可非也。括地志：渭陽五帝廟，在雍州咸陽縣東三十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韦昭曰：在渭城。师古曰：郊祀志云：在长安东北，非渭城也；韦说谬矣。余据水北为阳，长安在渭南，渭城在渭北，五帝庙或在渭城界，韦说未可非也。括地志：渭阳五帝庙，在雍州咸阳县东三十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac53-db0e-11ef-9d2d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-163,"link_td_description":"新垣平，赵国人，西汉人物，善于望气之术，因假造祥瑞欺骗汉文帝，被灭族。","link_td_id":"Q10013234","link_td_number_id":1577373,"people_name":"新垣平","people_name_jianti_auto":"新垣平","people_xingming":"新垣平","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac67-db0e-11ef-897f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","place_note":"河北邯郸","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac68-db0e-11ef-bf3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac69-db0e-11ef-bf07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭阳","resolved_place_entity_id":2473,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac6a-db0e-11ef-ba9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五帝廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"五帝庙","resolved_place_entity_id":4244,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac6b-db0e-11ef-979a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5趙人新垣平以望氣見上，言長安東北有神，氣成五采。於是作渭陽五帝廟。","content_fanyi":"赵国人新垣平凭借望气之术受到文帝召见，说长安东北方有神，神气结成五彩。于是文帝下令修建渭阳五帝庙。","content_jianti_auto":"5赵人新垣平以望气见上，言长安东北有神，气成五采。于是作渭阳五帝庙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1199,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac52-db0e-11ef-ab6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十五年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f036278-db0e-11ef-9712-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丙子、前一六五）","year_int":-165},"message":"success","success":true}